<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ingram Micro started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ingram Micro started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley began coverage of Ingram Micro Inc with an outperform rating on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed on the NYSE at 25-1/8.</p>
<p>-- The company went public in November at $18 a share. Morgan Stanley was the lead underwriter of the offering.</p>
</text>
